/target
# This is a library workspace: do not commit the lockfile.
Cargo.lock

# ...with one deliberate exception. The pointer contract is a frozen artifact
# whose compiled bytes must not change, so its lockfile pins the entire
# dependency graph and `build-wasm.sh` builds with `--locked`. Without the
# lockfile committed, a fresh resolve would pick different versions and re-key
# every pointer in the ecosystem.
# See contracts/pointer-contract/WASM-STABILITY.md.
!contracts/pointer-contract/Cargo.lock
contracts/pointer-contract/target
